( Mazak VQC 20/40 ATC/remap abort cleanup. )
( Called by [RS274NGC] ON_ABORT_COMMAND for interpreter, motion, E-stop, )
( task-state, and operator aborts. It commands no axis motion. )

o<on_abort> sub

  ( Assert the component-level abort first. Leave it asserted until the )
  ( next live M6 explicitly clears P8 at cycle entry. )
  M64 P8

  ( Stop magazine and remove tool/cover requests. The cover valve is )
  ( energise-to-close, so P1 off removes power rather than commanding )
  ( an unverified motion. Mechanical state must be inspected by operator. )
  M65 P3
  M65 P9                     ( item 10: stop a mid-flight return-pot index )
  M65 P2
  M65 P4
  M65 P1

  ( Drop finish/cycle requests and cancel spindle orient. )
  M65 P5
  M65 P0
  M65 P6
  M64 P7
  G4 P0.1
  M65 P7

  ( Restore non-motion modal state without attempting any recovery move. )
  M5
  M9
  G80
  G90
  G94

o<on_abort> endsub
M2
